Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.49,Principal Cinch 4K,,0,0,0,,I realize that you've always been an outcast\N我发现你经常遭受排挤
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.17,0:00:07.16,Principal Cinch 4K,,0,0,0,,It's not everyone at school who likes to think\N并不是学校里的每一个学生都愿意动脑思考
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.71,0:00:09.99,Principal Cinch 4K,,0,0,0,,To find a student that's like you\N与你相似的学生
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.18,0:00:12.20,Principal Cinch 4K,,0,0,0,,I've had one or maybe two\N我曾教过一两个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:15.20,Principal Cinch 4K,,0,0,0,,But the good ones disapear before I blink\N但眨眼之间已无影无踪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.77,0:00:16.10,Principal Cinch 4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1884,234)}Oh wuh oh wuh oh
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.24,0:00:18.18,Principal Cinch 4K,,0,0,0,,Oh wuh oh wuh
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.18,0:00:21.48,Principal Cinch 4K,,0,0,0,,Now I understand you have your reservations\N我知道你自己对此有所保留
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:25.56,Principal Cinch 4K,,0,0,0,,It's hard to have a brain as large as yours\N你的天资聪颖难以再寻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:23.06,Principal Cinch 4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1924,138)}Oh wuh
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.36,0:00:28.40,Principal Cinch 4K,,0,0,0,,But if we don't win these games\N但若输掉这比赛
